LangString BaselioDetail1 1041 "Baselio データ保護失敗 code=parent-path-unresolved path=$\"$baselioMessageDir\$baselioMessageFolder$\""
LangString BaselioDetail1 2052 "Baselio 数据保护失败 code=parent-path-unresolved path=$\"$baselioMessageDir\$baselioMessageFolder$\""
LangString BaselioDetail2 1033 "Could not safely preserve $\"$baselioMessageDir\$baselioMessageFolder$\"; its parent path could not be resolved."
LangString BaselioDetail2 1041 "$\"$baselioMessageDir\$baselioMessageFolder$\" を安全に保護できません。親パスを解決できませんでした。"
LangString BaselioDetail2 2052 "无法安全保护 $\"$baselioMessageDir\$baselioMessageFolder$\"；无法解析其父路径。"
LangString BaselioDetail3 1033 "Baselio data protection failure code=backup-already-exists path=$\"$baselioMessageDir\$baselioMessageFolder$\" backup=$\"$baselioMessageBackup$\""
LangString BaselioDetail3 1041 "Baselio データ保護失敗 code=backup-already-exists path=$\"$baselioMessageDir\$baselioMessageFolder$\" backup=$\"$baselioMessageBackup$\""
