LangString BaselioDetail5 1033 "Baselio data protection failure code=preserve-rename-failed path=$\"$baselioMessageDir\$baselioMessageFolder$\" backup=$\"$baselioMessageBackup$\""
LangString BaselioDetail5 1041 "Baselio データ保護失敗 code=preserve-rename-failed path=$\"$baselioMessageDir\$baselioMessageFolder$\" backup=$\"$baselioMessageBackup$\""
LangString BaselioDetail5 2052 "Baselio 数据保护失败 code=preserve-rename-failed path=$\"$baselioMessageDir\$baselioMessageFolder$\" backup=$\"$baselioMessageBackup$\""
LangString BaselioDetail6 1033 "Could not safely preserve $\"$baselioMessageDir\$baselioMessageFolder$\"; leaving the existing installation untouched."
LangString BaselioDetail6 1041 "$\"$baselioMessageDir\$baselioMessageFolder$\" を安全に保護できません。既存のインストールは変更されていません。"
